To support non-CUDA backends (such as NPU or XPU) that SGLang supports, we should pass `self.device` to `kimi_gpu_preprocess` instead of relying on the hardcoded `"cuda"` device.

```suggestion
    def _kimi_preprocess_images_gpu(self, images):
        from sglang.srt.multimodal.processors.kimi_k25 import kimi_gpu_preprocess

        return kimi_gpu_preprocess(
            images, self.image_processor.media_proc_cfg, device=self.device
        )
```

